s":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"1b74b11c9ce13e89f7699316b9819ecf54daa07729ddbfff06de03036b493ff3","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.sase-19f.1/chat.md","size_bytes":4568},"commits":{"digest":"671ed26e9c944c864e707b1d42d23e12f5a275529a7e6a7b19acd26c6f074bfb","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.sase-19f.1/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.sase-19f.1/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"21f0bf42dee2b973468a89f34af4811b5969b57fa0444f8bbbb9fa5546eaceb8","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.sase-19f.1/meta.json","size_bytes":5412},"prompt":{"digest":"82a7ca1db6be45c3602a31409bd06c523ddcdafb3aecfddc44975698d2544318","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.sase-19f.1/prompt.md","size_bytes":173},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"2a363f574c3fb4d649f9594cd45004c759a651a6ddec2bf95012894ed5ec5b41","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.sase-19f.1/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":8074},"state":{"digest":"bb3309b2b5891d14373f14d4aaeb21f92a546519d9b1de98d446669ddc9565b2","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.sase-19f.1/state.json","size_bytes":213}},"finished_at":"2026-09-25T17:06:46.749181+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.sase-19f.1","local_name":"sase-19f.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-19f","agent_clan_generation":"20260925122530","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-19f.1","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-19f[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]%queue capacity multiplier (<M>x)[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]The `%queue` / `%q` capacity argument accepts a multiplier `<M>x` [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim](at most two decimal places). Admission resolves it as M times the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]machine's effective `max_running_agents` budget. Every [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`#research_swarm` agent authors `%q(1.5x, w=0.25)`, so on a machine[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]whose effective budget is 5 each research agent gets a capacity of [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]7.5.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]queue_capacity_multiplier.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/queue_capacity_multiplier.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-19f[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-19f/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rust multiplier syntax, formatting, launch wires, and editor [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]metadata[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]core-parse[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-parse: in sase-core, parse and validate `<M>x` wherever `%queue` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]accepts capacity, carry it as `queue_capacity_multiplier` through [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]QueueFieldsWire and the typed agent/proc launch wires, format it [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]canonically, add helper bindings, and update the completion metadata.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rust admission resolution, scan records, and fleet contract[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core-admission[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-parse[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-admission: in sase-core, resolve a persisted multiplier against the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]request's effective_limit when computing the admission limit, add the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]field to runner-capacity records and waiters, agent-scan meta and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]waiting wires (with an index schema bump), and the fleet summary [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract, and extend the normalize binding.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]sase launch, persistence, admission, and continuation plumbing[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]sase-plumbing[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-admission[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]sase-plumbing: bump the sase-core pin. Then carry [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`queue_capacity_multiplier` from directive extraction through agent_meta[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and waiting markers, runner-slot admission records, typed-unit and proc [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]admission, and continuation reauthoring. Update the xprompt and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]runner-slot docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]TUI and CLI display plus capacity editing surfaces[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]sase-surfaces[dim] · [dim][/dim]after sase-plumbing[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]sase-surfaces: render multiplier capacities as `c1.5x` badges with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolved units in the TUI detail, wait lane, and queue ladder, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]expose them in agent-list JSON. The wait modal and the agent directive [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]edit commands accept `<M>x` and keep it when other queue fields are [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]edited.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Research swarm authors a 1.5x capacity multiplier[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]research-swarm[dim] · [dim][/dim]after sase-plumbing[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]research-swarm: in sase-research-artifacts, render `%q(1.5x, w=0.25)` in[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]every swarm segment, with the optional `runners` input replacing the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]multiplier with an absolute budget. Update the tests, wheel and publish [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]smokes, docs, and dependency floors where a published core supports it.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-19f","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-19f.1","reasoning_effort":"medium","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-acba38b6817dd55239af374137e3f62b","started_at":"2026-09-25T16:25:40.133162+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"fe7631c6cfdcddb560c9453df56f1d46a22614714b64f286be9d3156baa97709","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.sase-19f.2/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.sase-19f.2/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"ff1751ef0c119da6abd3db5fddaf9937c8a13eb79e81340d7f50591fe39b6840","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.sase-19f.2/meta.json","size_bytes":677},"prompt":{"digest":"532f049ada73eecbbb2b65758032162a1c08d1e2c18f24174ecb910269c21dbc","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.sase-19f.2/prompt.md","size_bytes":146},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"afb98559ee4742098ec6c05a25c71959b1db928c7900b54ad452e538209564f0","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.sase-19f.2/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":4204},"state":{"digest":"9e4825970f0561b6d8d9ce6ce5577012df510fa1c9a15ea1e62f1fe31f39e76d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.sase-19f.2/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.sase-19f.2","local_name":"sase-19f.2","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-19f","agent_clan_generation":"20260925122530","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-19f.2","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_tribe":"ep